  "changelog": "smyx-pet-toy-interaction-activity-analysis 1.0.0 \u2014 initial release\n\n- Provides pet toy interaction and activity analysis from uploaded or network videos, recognizing behaviors, tracking frequency, duration, and toy preferences for each pet.\n- Generates daily activity curves, trend comparisons, and alerts for sudden declines in activity that may indicate wellness issues.\n- Requires strict open-id acquisition before any analysis or querying of history, following a clear priority order and prohibiting default or guessed ids.\n- Automatically detects and handles user requests for history reports and outputs results in standardized Markdown tables.\n- All results and metrics are purely descriptive of pet interaction data, with no diagnostic conclusions.",
